{"page":61,"width":1649,"height":2152,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"제1장 데이터 모일랑의 이해","words":[{"text":"제1장","x":1190,"y":94,"width":58,"height":25},{"text":"데이터","x":1258,"y":93,"width":66,"height":24},{"text":"모일랑의","x":1336,"y":92,"width":82,"height":24},{"text":"이해","x":1431,"y":92,"width":41,"height":25}]},{"text":"나. 명칭, 내역 등과 같이 이름으로 기술되는 것은 피함","words":[{"text":"나.","x":179,"y":219,"width":39,"height":31},{"text":"명칭,","x":238,"y":220,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"내역","x":319,"y":221,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"등과","x":387,"y":222,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"같이","x":454,"y":222,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"이름으로","x":517,"y":222,"width":95,"height":30},{"text":"기술되는","x":624,"y":221,"width":96,"height":31},{"text":"것은","x":732,"y":222,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"피함","x":793,"y":222,"width":52,"height":31}]},{"text":"명칭, 내역 등과 같이 이름으로 기술되는 것들은 가능하면 주-식별자로 지정하지 않도록 한다. 예를 들어 한 회사에","words":[{"text":"명칭,","x":217,"y":287,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"내역","x":293,"y":287,"width":50,"height":30},{"text":"등과","x":355,"y":288,"width":53,"height":29},{"text":"같이","x":416,"y":289,"width":48,"height":29},{"text":"이름으로","x":477,"y":289,"width":92,"height":28},{"text":"기술되는","x":579,"y":288,"width":89,"height":29},{"text":"것들은","x":678,"y":288,"width":68,"height":29},{"text":"가능하면","x":754,"y":288,"width":92,"height":30},{"text":"주-식별자로","x":857,"y":288,"width":119,"height":30},{"text":"지정하지","x":986,"y":286,"width":93,"height":31},{"text":"않도록","x":1091,"y":286,"width":73,"height":30},{"text":"한다.","x":1175,"y":287,"width":55,"height":29},{"text":"예를","x":1241,"y":287,"width":52,"height":29},{"text":"들어","x":1302,"y":288,"width":49,"height":28},{"text":"한","x":1364,"y":288,"width":25,"height":28},{"text":"회사에","x":1398,"y":288,"width":73,"height":27}]},{"text":"부서 이름이 1%개가 있다고 하자. 각각의 부서 이름은 유일하게 구별될 수 있다고 하여 이를 주식별자로 지정하지","words":[{"text":"부서","x":176,"y":333,"width":58,"height":29},{"text":"이름이","x":249,"y":333,"width":79,"height":29},{"tex